                                    <p class="paper-date">
                                        26 August 2026
                                    </p>


                                    <p>
                                        Dear Bursary Selection Committee,
                                    </p>


                                    <p>
                                        My name is Delton Novela, and I am
                                        currently pursuing a Bachelor of Science
                                        in Computer Science and Informatics at
                                        the University of Johannesburg. I am
                                        writing to express my sincere interest
                                        in receiving financial assistance to
                                        support my studies and continue working
                                        towards my academic and professional goals.
                                    </p>


                                    <p>
                                        My passion for technology and computer
                                        science has motivated me to build a
                                        future in the technology industry. I
                                        believe that education provides me with
                                        the opportunity to develop the skills,
                                        knowledge and experience necessary to
                                        make a meaningful contribution to society.
                                    </p>


                                    <p>
                                        Receiving this bursary would reduce the
                                        financial pressure associated with my
                                        studies and allow me to focus more fully
                                        on my academic responsibilities. I am
                                        committed to making the most of this
                                        opportunity and maintaining strong
                                        academic performance.
                                    </p>


                                    <p>
                                        I would be grateful for the opportunity
                                        to receive your support and demonstrate
                                        my commitment, determination and potential.
                                    </p>


                                    <p>
                                        Yours sincerely,
                                    </p>


                                    <p class="paper-signature">
                                        <strong>
                                            Delton Novela
                                        </strong>

                                        <br />

                                        BSc Computer Science and Informatics

                                        <br />

                                        University of Johannesburg

